# Testing
- vitest. Every function in `src/stats/` and every SQL template has unit tests with known inputs and outputs.
- Tests never call the network; use fakes for Zetaris and model providers (fake clock for the pacer).
- SQL templates are executed against DuckDB in tests.
- Never assert on saved model outputs; assert on structure and deterministic code paths.
